id: profiling
name: Profiling
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Intuition
requiresSkill: intuition
requiresRanks: 2
# "Session Limit: Infinite."
sessionLimit: infinite
timeCost: 1 Minute
# "Target a Character you can see. Make a Clash (Intuition vs Bluff/Intuition) against that Character."
clashSkill: intuition
clashDefenderSkills: bluff, intuition
# "You cannot target the same Character with the Profiling Maneuver more than once during an
# Adventuring Session."
oncePerTarget: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Intuition Clash against someone's Bluff or Intuition: the ARC tells you about their personality
  and intentions - true if you win, false if you lose. Once for each Character in an Adventuring
  Session.
text: >
  Profiling: You build a detailed personality profile about an individual, determining whether or not
  they are a potential threat.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Intuition
  –Session Limit: Infinite
  –Time Cost: 1 Minute
  –Effect: Target a Character you can see. Make a Clash (Intuition vs Bluff/Intuition) against that
  Character. If you win or lose, the ARC will supply you with information about that Character’s
  personality and their intentions. If you win, this information will be true. If you lose, this
  information will be false. You cannot target the same Character with the Profiling Maneuver more than
  once during an Adventuring Session.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Intuition, with no Session Limit. Used at the
# one token targeted - refused if they were already Profiled this Adventuring Session - and the Clash
# card opens at once. Nothing is added when it settles (the user's ruling): the Clash is seen, and what
# the ARC tells them - true or false - is the table's.
